 r←Test_AskNumber_008(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;cl;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "AskForNumber" method with defaults parameters only. Input via insert clipboard. See also no 1.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Number of copies'

 n←myGuiParms parms(#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber ∆Ask)''
 ⎕DL 0.2
 cl←⎕NEW⊂'Clipboard'
 cl.Text←'33'
 ⎕NQ n.Input'GotFocus'
 ⎕NQ n.Input'KeyPress' 'PT'
 ⎕NQ n.Input 9995
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp 33≢n.Input.Value
 →T.GoToTidyUp'Length: 2'{⍺≢(⍴⍺)↑⍵}n.StatusField1.Text

 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp 33≢n.∆result
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
